# Cuento

> Open-source forum software for play-by-post roleplaying communities.

Cuento is a full-stack forum platform (Go backend, Angular 22 frontend) purpose-built for play-by-post (PbP) roleplaying. Key features: first-class character system with custom fields and masks, episodes and games as native objects, subforum-level ACL permissions, built-in AI narration assist and game digest (Claude/Gemini/OpenAI), end-to-end encrypted direct messages, semantic and full-text search (Sonic + Qdrant), and one-command VPS deploy via the Cuento CLI.

Source code: https://github.com/topics/cuento

